{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bQCwflL4Nh1792993395.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產大埔白石角大學山分行經理巫燕虹表示，利好消息帶動下，整體交投氣氛正面，分行最新錄大埔白石角海日灣II 13座高層D室，單位實用面積622平方呎，2房連儲物房間隔，議價後以948萬元沽出，平均實用呎價約15,241元。</p><p><br/>中原巫燕虹表示，新買家為區內換樓客，見屋苑環境舒適，單位價錢合理，即決定購入單位自住。據了解，原業主於2021年以1,027萬元購入單位，持貨約5年，是次轉手賬面蝕79萬元離場，單位期內貶值約7.7%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:53.877315+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T06:18:16.046553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:10.475386+00:00","content_hash":"1d2cb62086fe7a211baa1d5bb670d0a871c493513347fa63b1c0e0c31bdd405f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:53.877315+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}